# Cursor AI Contributor Standards

## 1. Safety Guardrails
- **Branch Protection:** All tasks must branch from `main` to `ai/cursor-<issue-number>-<description>`. Never push directly to `main`.
- **Zero Secrets:** Do not generate or hardcode API keys or secrets.
- **Scope Discipline:** Focus exclusively on files directly relevant to the issue.

## 2. Verification Mandate
- Execute repository test commands before concluding the task.
- Ensure all TypeScript/Python type checks pass with zero errors.
- Document any environment requirements or migrations in the PR description.

## 3. Pull Request Requirements
- Fill out `.github/pull_request_template.md`.
- Include the `<!-- AI-CONTRIBUTOR-METADATA -->` block declaring the exact model executed.
